  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Major Star Shikigami</em></p>\n<p>You have learned that strengthening cursed energy lets you summon stronger shikigami. You can spend 1 additional cursed energy when you summon your Major Star Shikigami to increase its size category to Large. This increases to 2 cursed energy to make it Huge at 11th level and 4 cursed energy to make it Gargantuan at 18th level. For every size category larger than medium, it gains the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>+4 bonus to Strength score  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+1d8 damage to Bite attacks  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 hit points</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
